      "content": "idk, i dont think there are any anchors left. everything feels so fake. like i'm just performing these daily routines for a world that doesn't even want me there anymore. it's like i'm already dead, just stuck in this loop of pretending to be alive so people don't ask questions. it's exhausting.",
